usage: script_forge_qc [-h] --base BASE {latest,summary,last-status,path} ...

Query DIL Script Forge QC registry data

positional arguments:
  {latest,summary,last-status,path}
    latest              show recent test runs
    summary             summarize runs by suite/tool/status
    last-status         show latest status
    path                print the test run registry path

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --base BASE           DIL base path
